WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.400
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.910
You are my sun now

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.340
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.340
no matter who you are

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.760
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:45.480
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:50.860
is clear again

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:56.240
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.740
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:05.080
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:08.750
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:16.590
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:23.390
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:30.770
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:38.110
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.200
<i>All seven gems have been recovered,
and all seven tribes have united.</i>

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.100
<i>Furthermore, in their quest
to find the king's heir,</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:13.600
<i>Lief and his friends finally rescued
Dain from execution in Del Palace.</i>

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:20.800
<i>Believing Dain to be the heir,
Lief tried to bestow the belt upon him.</i>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.600
<i>But then Dain began to sneer
and mock Lief and the others.</i>

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.400
What's wrong, Dain...?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.000
What a dense person you are.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.760
At this moment, I'm feeling as great as can be.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.600
You lowly humans.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:07.440
I can finally reveal my true self to you all.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:15.400
All this time, I have been positively itching
to tell you all just how foolish you are.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.950
No way...

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:33.300
To think that nobody ever noticed that I
had been disguising myself as this blade!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:38.500
There are special kinds of Ols that
can turn into anything they please.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.980
Lief, I even went so far as to
explain this to you in the past.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.500
Dain...

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:50.800
You...

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.450
were the spy...?!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:58.000
You hung me on your belt while
I took the form of this blade.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.100
And there you were, constantly on the
verge of tears worrying about me.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:08.500
But, I was right there at your
side, baring witness to it all.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.500
So you had Ichabod come for
you on purpose, didn't you?

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.900
You were just playing with Lief's kindness!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.200
Jasmine, I very much enjoyed
my time together with you.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.200
So you were also the one who told
the Shadow Lord of our names.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.000
What of that Jinx memo?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.800
That was also my handiwork.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.000
How pitiable it was that his
own friends were to doubt him.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:44.040
I never could have imagined that
you'd completely fool us like this.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:52.600
Dain, I trusted you!

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.000
I believed that you were the heir of Deltora...!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.500
Yes, and fooling you into thinking
that was my plan all along.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.200
I was created for that very purpose, in fact!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.110
With this, I need not fear the
Belt of Deltora any longer.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:19.200
This unsightly belt will soon become
little more than rusted scrap.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.120
Getting to this point really was hard work.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:30.500
Getting captured by those bandits
was well outside my calculations.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.770
Not to mention, that business
in Tora almost did me in.

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:39.900
There were times when I thought
about just killing the lot of you.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:46.900
But, as per the Shadow Lord's orders,
I was forbidden from taking such action.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:53.400
The Shadow Lord even promised to give me
this entire kingdom if all went as planned.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.600
I would be a far more capable
ruler than that Fallow man, after all!

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.250
Shit...!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.500
Your usefulness has now
come to an end, humans.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:15.880
Lief, you can now suffer and
die in your beloved homeland!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.310
Ols?!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.600
<i>Even though...</i>

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.300
<i>Even though we had finally found all of the gems,</i>

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:27.400
<i>and all I needed to do was
give the Belt to the royal heir...</i>

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.210
<i>I never would have imagined...</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.100
<i>that Dain, who had been with us for so long...</i>

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:39.510
Lief!!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.100
Are you okay?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.060
Y-Yeah... sorry...

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.600
There's nothing to apologise for.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.100
We're friends, right?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.500
Friends...

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:08.300
You will die here, along with
those 'friends' of yours.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.400
What a bunch of fools!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.500
We may be foolish,

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:19.130
but, we're far better than someone like
you who betrays and deceives others!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:26.700
There's no way in hell that I'm going to let
someone like you steal the Belt of Deltora!!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:30.900
Lief!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.700
Get it through your heads!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.730
You have no way of winning.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.000
Lief!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.300
Move it...!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.410
Dain! Where are you?!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.300
Over there!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.200
Did you get him, Jasmine?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.200
Yes.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.300
Looks like you've been fooled again!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.630
I'm over here!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.600
That was just an Ol who took my form.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.300
No way...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.300
Watch out!!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.360
Doom?!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.300
Foolish as always.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:43.600
Hang on!

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.090
Doom!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.900
I'm... alright...

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.300
More importantly... you must go after Dain...

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:56.800
But...

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.200
Go, Lief.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.100
Go now, Lief!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.100
Hurry!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:10.740
I'll leave it to you!

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:18.700
Doom,

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.800
I'll treat your injury soon!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:21.900
Just hang on!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.100
Jasmine!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.300
You need to run!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.920
If I run, then who will treat him?!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.800
Doom was hurt because he was protecting me...

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.200
Get out of here...!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.400
Leave me behind...!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.500
Doom!

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.400
At this rate, everyone will...

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.300
We can't just leave you here!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.200
You saved my life!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.500
As well as that, you're an important friend to me!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.370
Let go of me!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.700
Representatives of the seven tribes!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.700
We must retreat at once!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.970
We are all going to be captured at this rate!

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.700
Yeah. Better we run than have us all die.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.200
Alright.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:27.700
We will retreat and regroup.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.500
This map shows the location of a hidden room.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.100
You can make your way there.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.400
What about you, Manus?

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.120
I will go and find Lief and
explain our situation to him.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.120
Please do.

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:51.130
Dain!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.160
<i>I have to take back the
Belt of Deltora at all costs!</i>

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.000
I've found you, Dain!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.800
Dain!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.650
Persistent bastard.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:55.100
Are you that desperate to die by my hand?

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.160
If so, then I will gladly take your life!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:18.500
Unlike normal Ols, I have a
number of powerful abilities.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.300
There's no way I'd lose to the likes of you!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:08.300
Each time you cut through my body,
you only make me stronger!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.700
You imbecile!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.100
<i>To think that he would grow
stronger each time I cut him...</i>

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:23.280
<i>An Ol's weakness...</i>

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.500
<i>is its heart on the right.</i>

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.900
<i>I have to stab him there somehow.</i>

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.700
Where are you aiming?

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:43.900
I...

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.200
I missed!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.600
You have my thanks.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:55.600
You've gone to the trouble of armouring
my weak point for my own protection.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.700
It's no use...!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.100
Are you okay, Lief?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.300
You look like you're in pain.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.000
Let me help you.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.600
Grab onto this.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.200
B-But...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.160
You're...

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.100
Come.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.670
Hurry and grab on!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.000
D...

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:54.830
Dain...

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.700
I've fooled you yet again.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.000
You poor, good-natured boy.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:14.690
I absolutely loathe idealistic people like you!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.480
Come on, come on.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.600
Does it hurt?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.990
Kneel before me and beg for forgiveness!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.200
Like the pathetic boy you are!

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.300
Now, say it.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:41.400
"Lord Dain, please forgive me!"

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:45.000
If you do, I will spare your life at least!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.000
There's no way...

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.000
that I will say that...!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.600
I will defeat you!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.100
Very well.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:58.860
I will shut that insolent mouth of yours, then!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:08.360
<i>My sword...</i>

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:10.910
<i>My sword...!</i>

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:19.100
Now then!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.000
Shall I tear you limb from limb?!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.770
It's you...!

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:50.800
The one who shall defeat that boy and
be recognised by the Shadow Lord,

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.400
is myself!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:59.300
And that very same Shadow Lord
thinks that you're utterly useless!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.300
Not to mention cowardly!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.900
You would never be able to defeat me!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.100
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.000
<i>The Belt...!</i>

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:08.900
What?!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.200
The Belt!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.100
Take it off!!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.700
Even... if you defeat me...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.000
do you actually...

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:43.800
do you actually think you can
defeat the Shadow Lord...?

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.700
Foolish human...

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.890
You should give up here and be done with it...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.200
Help me...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.330
Lief...!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.700
Dain...!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:51.100
<i>If Dain is not the heir,</i>

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.780
<i>then who could it be?</i>

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:57.900
<i>Where is the successor to the throne of Deltora...?</i>

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.700
Your comrades have been captured!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.800
Huh?

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:08.000
If you want to save them, then come
with the Belt and bring it before the king!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:19.100
Now then, I had best report
Dain's failure to the Shadow Lord.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:24.500
Only the smart ones get to survive until the end.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.500
Lief!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.360
Manus!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.200
Is it true that everyone was captured?!

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.530
Barda and Jasmine were, along with Doom.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.100
But, all of the representatives are safe!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.700
They escaped to a hidden room.

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:51.100
Is that so...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.300
Let's regroup, then save Barda and the others!

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.600
Okay.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:57.500
Let's go!

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:11.200
Doom...

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:13.000
Hang in there!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:15.800
Jasmine, the medicine.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.100
I'm sorry.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.000
This happened because of me.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.300
Jasmine...

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.800
What is it?

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:50.200
Hurry up... and hide...

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.000
Huh?

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:53.200
Run away...!

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.570
What do you mean?

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:56.820
Doom...

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:01.300
You at the very least must be safe...

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.000
My beautiful Jasmine...

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.420
It couldn't be...

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:15.200
It couldn't be...!

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:19.000
<i>Jasmine.</i>

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.400
<i>Barda.</i>

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:21.600
<i>Doom.</i>

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:23.400
Wait for me.

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:27.100
I will... I will save you!

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:53.140
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:58.930
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.680 --> 00:23:05.480
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:11.280
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:18.250
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:21.830
At this point

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:27.500
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:33.800
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.100
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:47.190
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:55.570
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:08.500
The Seven Gems: the Amethyst.

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:13.000
<i>The sixth gem, found in the Maze of the
Beast and belonging to the Toran tribe.</i>

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.800
<i>It reveals the truth,</i>

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.000
<i>and its colour dulls in the presence of poison.</i>

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.630
<i>It also possesses calming powers.</i>

00:24:20.900 --> 00:24:22.800
After regrouping with the representatives,

00:24:22.800 --> 00:24:25.880
we search far and wide for our
friends captured by Fallow.

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:29.890
In the midst of all this, Doom's
shocking past is revealed.

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:34.570
Do-or-Die Rescue Mission

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:34.200
Next time, 'Do-or-Die Rescue Mission'.

00:24:49.590 --> 00:24:54.630
See you next time
